# Real exported bundle contains student PII; never commit it. The Android
# workflow does not need it (flutter build apk works with an empty/missing
# asset; wiring pubspec.yaml assets: entry is a later task), and the
# retrieval-layer tests build their own hermetic fixture database instead.
assets/brain.db

# The exported corpus bundle. Never committed: it holds 369 real student names,
# roll numbers and results, and this repository is public. It reaches the phone
# by `adb push` instead — see docs/MOBILE_RUNBOOK.md. Rebuild it any time with
#   python scripts/export_mobile_bundle.py
assets/brain.db

# Generated by the Flutter tool per machine: absolute SDK paths that are wrong
# on every other machine, including the CI runner that produced them.
android/local.properties
android/.gradle/
android/app/build/
android/build/
*.iml

# Runtime secrets pushed to the device, never committed. The repo is public.
assets/config.json
